      <div type="clause" n="16">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 16</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be cys wyrhte . Cyswyhrtan gebyreð hunded cyse 7 þæt heo of wringhwæge buteran macige to hlafordes beode . 7 hæbbe hire ða syringe ealle butan ðæs hyrdes dæle .</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning the cheese-wright To the cheese-wright is due a hundred cheeses and that she make butter from the strained whey for the lord’s table, and she [should] have all the sour milk except the shepherd’s portion.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[16] Be cyswyrhte Cyswyrhtan gebyreð hundred cyse, 7 þæt heo of wringhwæge buteran macige to hlafordes beode; 7 hæbbe hire ða syringe ealle butan ðæs hyrdes dæle.</ab>
      </div>
